From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a webview's context menu is the shell's to draw

Three lists, so that the event a `<webview>` dispatches when its page asks
for a context menu -- `DomicileContextMenuEvent` -- is compiled and reaches
the page: `core/html/build.gni` builds it, `idl_in_core.gni` generates its
bindings, and `generated_in_core.gni` names the generated pair. And the
binder hands every guest `domicile::OpenDevTools`, which a menu's "inspect"
and the element's `inspect()` run: DevTools' front end is //chrome's, which
the guest's own target cannot depend on.

Everything else is new files and edits under src/: the event, the
`ContextMenuRequested` member on WebViewGuestClient, `RunContextMenuAction`
and `Inspect` on WebViewGuest, and DevTools attached in a <webview>.

The position in each list is beside patch 0078's popup window event, and
the context is the lists as 0078 leaves them; the binder's is the file as
0060 leaves it. The post-image blob hashes are zeroed, for the reason patch
0035 gives.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium;
`guard-webview-context-menu.sh` measures it on `crux` with the rest of the
engine job.
---
 chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc        | 6 +++++-
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni | 2 ++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni       | 1 +
 third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/build.gni            | 2 ++
 4 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
index a9bfcfdcce..0000000000 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_extension_tray.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_pointer_warp.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_tab_helpers.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_devtools.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/color_scheme.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/control_channel.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/keyboard_layout.h"
@@ -582,7 +583,10 @@ void PopulateChromeFrameBinders(
         // they are handed in here -- see domicile_tab_helpers.h.
         domicile::BindWebViewGuestHost(
             frame, std::move(receiver),
-            base::BindRepeating(&domicile::AttachTabHelpers));
+            base::BindRepeating(&domicile::AttachTabHelpers),
+            // And DevTools, which is //chrome's for the same reason -- see
+            // domicile_devtools.h.
+            base::BindRepeating(&domicile::OpenDevTools));
       }));
 
   // Domicile's engine fork: the extensions' tray, for the shell.
